{"4634810": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Crisis R", "steam_appid": 4634810, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4634810/extras/21a723e96f92377b71e57059a8b1cfee.avif?t=1781688689\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4634810/extras_big/21a723e96f92377b71e57059a8b1cfee.avif?t=1781688689 width=1560 height=878 /></span>A.D 2150, unidentified invaders arrives at the edge of the solar system. Several human colonies and installations around were destroyed as the invaders make their way towards Earth signalling their hostile intentions. The remaining forces from Earth scrambles to retaliate as they face humanity largest crisis...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CRISIS R (originally release on Google Play) is a arcade side scrolling shooter drawing inspirations from classics shooter from the 16-Bit era. Clear missions to unlock  weapons. Earn credits to upgrade weapons, shields and energy. Equip up to 3 weapons for each mission. Select your arsenal wisely, as the unique characteristic of each weapon can make or break each mission. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic Arcade Side Scrolling Shooter with 3D graphics &amp; effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >14 Challenging Missions with progressive difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 Different Weapons + Overload Feature to enhance weapon effect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade Weapons, Shields and Energy </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock 2 additional fighters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game does not use AI generated content</p></li></